window.products.push({"id":350095,"name":"APEX by Promounts AFMSS6402 Large TV Floor Stand Mount with 35° Swivel by Apex","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BCW20ApXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Built with quality in mind, the APEX by Promounts 37 In. to 70 In. Large TV Floor Stand Mount is a new way to mount your TV. This mount supports most 37 in. to 70 in. displays weighing up to 88 lb. and the unique design of its universal mounting brackets mean compatibility is almost guaranteed. For precise compatibility, simply check your display’s VESA pattern against the VESA range between 200 x 200 to 600 x 400. If your display’s VESA matches or falls within this range, then your display is compatible. It’s that easy! From the Manufacturer PPlatinum PA-1B Wall Mounted Articulated Mount - Articulated and Retractable The Platinum PA-1 Wall Mounted Articulated Mount is a heavy duty dual arm flat panel mount allowing maximum extension and optimum viewing from any position. This modern design offers tremendous flexibility with features that allow adjustment from flush on wall positioning up to 15 inches extension from the wall. The heavy duty dual-arms are Extends up to 15 inches from the wall(Shown in black) designed for maximum extension, folding flush to the wall and viewing from multiple positions. The wall plate attaches to a single wooden stud as well as in concrete or aggregate walls. QUAD Technology The Platinum PA-1 Wall Mounted Articulated Mount is a universal wall mount and comes complete with the all new SCM-300 self-centering adaptor with Patent Pending QUAD (Quick Universal Adaptor Design) technology. QUAD dramatically decreases the time needed for a safe and easy installation ensuring precise centering of the flat panel display at all times. The Platinum PA-1 Wall Mounted Articulated Mount is designed for flat panel displays up to 40 lbs. Easy to Use Features The Platinum PA-1 Wall Mounted Articulated Mount comes fully assembled. Its superior design allows for a wide range of motion and ample room for cabling. It is a universal design which means no screen adapters are necessary. The heavy duty arm extends up to 15 inches from the wall and rotates from Landscape to Portrait settings. It comes with complete cable management including attractive end caps to conceal tensioning bolts and \"quick snap\" covers for complete cable management. It is VESA compliant for 75 and 100. All of the screen and wall mounting hardware is included. To protect your investment, the Platinum PA-1 Wall Mounted Articulated Mount includes a Manufacturer's Limited Lifetime Warranty. Platinum Products Philosophy Today, the company designs, builds, and markets a highly targeted line of mounts for flat panels and projectors. Platinum Products' design philosophy is one of minimalism, striving for fewer, more versatile products that can solve a greater number of mounting needs with a superior level of construction, fit, and finish. All of the Platinum Products TV mounts are developed and designed with real world installer input to create this concise and versatile product line. Find the Right Type and Size of Platinum HD Mount for Your TV Click within in the image to find the right size and type for your HDTV Technical Specifications Maximum load: 40 lbs Maximum load: 40 lbs TV size: between 10 and 24 inches TV size: between 10 and 24 inches Horizontal holespacing: between 2.95 and 3.93 inches Horizontal holespacing: between 2.95 and 3.93 inches Vertical holespacing: between 2.95 and 3.93 inches Vertical holespacing: between 2.95 and 3.93 inches VESA compliant: For 75 and 100 VESA compliant: For 75 and 100 Universal mount: Yes Universal mount: Yes Shipping weight: 3 lbs Shipping weight: 3 lbs Color: Black Color: Black Included: All panel and wall mounting hardware Included: All panel and wall mounting hardware","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BCW20ApXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Platinum HD Mounts","source_asin":"B001UE6TNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001UE6TNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001UE6TNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350096,"name":"NewlineNY Inflatable TPU Travel Neck Pillow (Blue) with Drawstring Carrying Pouch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HWSmeM11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This NewlineNY Inflatable TPU neck pillow is another “we care” products for neck protection and travel companion. The ergonomic design (after inflate to around 80% of capacity) perfectly contours around your neck, effectively reducing the pressure over your cervical vertebra and shoulder. It is made by a high quality TPU material giving you the soft, comfortable and clean feeling. It can be inflated or deflected within a few seconds, thanks to the modern patented air valve. The NewlineNY Neck Pillow weighs only around 1.5 oz, and it comes with a small drawstring carrying pouch (0.2 oz) 3”x4”. It is light, easy and handy for traveling. This neck pillow is not only a good companion for travel, but also excellent as a relaxing pillow in office, home, watching TV, reading or napping. Also available in different color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HWSmeM11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewlineNY","source_asin":"B06XCX46X1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XCX46X1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XCX46X1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
