window.products.push({"id":350147,"name":"Sunset Trading Andrews Dining Table, Antique white with distressed chestnut top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1192.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NA1-OwAHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome guests into your home with this classic and timeless table from the Sunset Trading Andrews Collection. Whether it's casual \"coffee and conversation\", everyday dining, holidays or special occasions, memories are guaranteed to be made when family and friends gather around this versatile dining table. Warm and inviting, the classic beauty and craftsmanship of this dining table makes it equally appropriate for your kitchen or dining room fulfilling all your formal and informal dining needs. Mix and match this table with your choice of Sunset Andrews Collection chairs and buffet server (sold separately) to personalize your dining space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NA1-OwAHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunset Trading","source_asin":"B07MZ6R28F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MZ6R28F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MZ6R28F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350148,"name":"nuLOOM Marcia Machine Washable Faux Cowhide Area Rug, 5' x 6' 7\", Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913trrcXqTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913trrcXqTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B09HKXVHXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HKXVHXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HKXVHXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350149,"name":"Peugeot Ressort Aerator, Glass/Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ufFUdIN-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For more than a century, the Peugeot name has been synonymous with French gourmet cooking. Recently, an opportunity arose for Peugeot to bring its penchant for quality and innovation to a family of wine products. Since then, Peugeot has offered a wide range of corkscrews, specialized decanters, tasting glasses and service accessories to wine aficionados worldwide. Wine lovers have their own tastes and preferences for not only their favorite vintage, but the best way to enjoy it. No one is particularly right or wrong, because the appreciation of wine is a personal experience. One point most wine lovers can agree on is that the proper tools and atmosphere enhances the senses and improves overall enjoyment. Peugeot's two piece Ressort Aerator combines a hand-blown glass funnel and a stainless steel spiral insert with a ball at the tip. As you pour the wine into the funnel, it passes over the spiral and slows down- which encourages maximum oxygen exposure. Works best with young red wines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ufFUdIN-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B0013SUU3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0013SUU3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0013SUU3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
