window.products.push({"id":350213,"name":"Premium Vacuum Storage Bags, 10 Pack Home Space Saver Bags (1 x Jombo, 2 x Large,3 x Medium,4 x Small) + a Electric Pump, XL Vacuum Storage Bags for C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6109YquimPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Maxspace Vacuum Storage Bags take the new generation storage idea to a completely different level. The volume of the stored items can be reduced by up to 75%. Maximize the use of your wardrobe and space.It includes 10 packs(1 x Jombo, 2 x Large,3 x Medium,4 x small) and a treval Eletric pump in the package . The jumbo size can store extra large items such as duvets, bed sheets, clothes, towels, blankets, pillows and any thick clothes. It will effectively save spaces for luggage and closet. The bulky item won’t bother you anymore whenever staying home or travelling. Double Zip Seal-No Air Leakage Our product uses double zip seal and airtight value to guarantee the sealing of the vacuum bags. Our double zip seal has been tested in many situations, the results show that the air leakage issue can be improved and solved by the new design of double zip seal. They are made of high quality PA+PE material which keeps your clothes away from odor, pests, dust and moisture. Convenience and Utility: To ensure better sealing performance, please slide the zipper across the bag 2-3 times and use your hand to press the sealing line. After, vacuum out the air, then tighten the cap and make sure the rubber stopper is fitted.When you need the article of clothing, just open the bag and release the air. Everything that was placed inside, stays nice and wrinkle free also kept away from dust or any dirt; when not being used, it's a great way to even store anyplace inside the home. NOTE: 1. DO NOT store the bag near sharp objects. DO NOT put any items with sharp object in bag.2. If the air leaks in after 24-48 hours, you need to check again whether the seal is good (Is there any hair or sundries in zipper). It's very important.Please operate according to the above process. Package Includes 10 * Vacuum Bags 1 * Eletric Pump","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6109YquimPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxspace","source_asin":"B07RQQRTDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQQRTDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQQRTDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
