window.products.push({"id":350267,"name":"LIKIMIO Queen Bed Frame with Headboard, Velvet Upholstered Platform Beds with Strong Wooden Slats/Mattress Foundation/Easy Assembly, Royal Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":120.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+9zzVFbJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy construction: With a load capacity up to 880lbs, this platform bed frame has 4 wooden legs, 2 additional metal legs, and a brace connecting the sides, top wooden slats are held in place with velcro, all to make for a solid platform base to support any mattress. Soft Velvet Fabric: Special Royal blue design and Velvet headboard makes it a style statement bed that adds character to your room. The subtle velvet fabric headboard is luxurious to the touch, feel so comfortable when you lean on it. No Gap between Headboard and Frame: Compared with general headboards, we lengthened our headboard by adding an extra Wooden Board under the headboard to fully connect the headboard to the frame, which prevents pillows or things from falling down to the floor. Under-bed Storage: Bed Dimensions: D*W*H: 80\"*60.2\"*43\". Close to 7-inch clearance under the bed was a bonus so as to allow you to store some sundries. Quick Installation: No further tools needed. This bed frame and headboard's all parts were labeled to make them easy to find. The directions are very clear and precise. It only takes about 30 mins for an adult to assemble. EXCELLENT SERVICE: If you have any problem, please do not hesitate to contact us first, we will solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+9zzVFbJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIKIMIO","source_asin":"B0BNLBYP2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNLBYP2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNLBYP2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
