window.products.push({"id":350271,"name":"Air Fryer Paper, Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, [105, 7.9''*6.3''], Food Grade Air Fryer Liners, Air Fryer Parchment Paper, Waterproof Oilproof Thi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K6G2ANF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Notices]: 1. Food should not be placed too little. Food cover area of the parchment: 2/3. 2. The temperature cannot exceed 220℃/428°F. 3. Do not put the paper in the air fryer while it is preheating. 4.Maximum heating time: 45 minutes (5-15 minutes extended with enough food) [Easy to Clean]: The air fryer liner prevents food from coming into direct contact with the fryer, protecting your air fryer from food debris and keeping your air fryer clean, making cleaning times faster and easier. [Healthy & Safe & Eco-friendly Material]: This air fryer parchment paper is made of food grade pulp, 100% healthy, no fluorescent agent, clean and odor free. Double-sided vegetable silicone oil, anti-stick and oil-proof, easy to clean, which is beneficial to protect the inner pot of the pot and prolong the service life. This is also safe for food packaging as certified by the Global SGS verification body. [Suitable for Majority of Air Fryers]: 105 pcs, 7.9*6.3 inches, length 20cm, width 16cm, height 4.5cm, bottom diameter 16cm, suit for 2-5 quart air fryer. It adopts round bowl-shaped design, blister packaging, easy to take and not easy to deform. This round air fryer liner is also suitable for microwaves, ovens, steamers, and more. The air fryer disposable liners round can also be used for baking, frying or serving, suitable for home baking, camping, grilling, etc., lightweight and practical. [Customer Service]: We have been focusing on kitchen supplies for many years, and we are choosing the highest quality and standard-compliant materials. We are always working towards making our products better. If there's any question, please feel free to contact us. Contact Way:(Sold by)store name -> Ask a question. We will provide a solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K6G2ANF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASTARB","source_asin":"B09STJGMGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09STJGMGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09STJGMGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350272,"name":"Calindiana Modern Farmhouse Metal Laundry Soap Dispenser Container Holder with Scoop for Laundry Room Decor and Space Saving Laundry Room Organization","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AAaqdHXNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CALINDIANA LAUNDRY COLLECTION: Fill your laundry room with Calindiana Laundry Collection! We feature modern farmhouse laundry room style and are focused on enhancing laundry room organization and storage. Use this powder bin to store any laundry essentials of your choice (just not any liquids), get our dryer sheets holder to store dryer sheets or dryer balls, and also get our lint bin to use it as a lint trash can. Go get our entire laundry collection and you won’t be disappointed! MODERN FARMHOUSE DESIGN: Modern product design with a word ‘laundry‘ is printed on a farmhouse style laundry powder container with a wooden handle providing modern farmhouse touch to your laundry room. This laundry storage tin’s mint green color will blend seamlessly with any laundry interior scheme and is a wonderful alternative to cardboard laundry detergent boxes MULTI-PURPOSE STORAGE TIN: Remember only a word ‘laundry’ is printed on this laundry storage tin. With that being said, why limit the purpose of this storage tin for laundry powder? This storage tin is perfect to store not only the laundry powder but detergent pods, dryer balls, dryer sheets, lint, and so much more HIGH QUALITY: If you need a laundry storage box that will hold up under any conditions, look no further. This storage box is made of sturdy tin metal and spacious enough with 7(L)X5.9(W)X9(H) inch size dimensions. It also features two side handles so you can easily transport it to anywhere and a wooden handle lid to keep your laundry essentials clean and dry. Scoop is also included and it has a hooked top so you can hang it over the two side handles of a storage box CAPACITY: Size of our powder bin is not huge but is definitely spacious enough to store a large amount of laundry essentials. It is capable of storing 100oz or 6lbs of laundry powder or approximately 100 laundry pods. Our scoop is able to hold 2 oz of laundry powder per each scoop PACKAGING DESIGN: Keep this laundry storage tin for your own laundry room or give it to your loved ones as a gift. This storage tin is packaged with a beautiful and elegant looking box and is a great gift option for your surroundings SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We are highly confident in our products. If for any reason you are not satisfied with our storage tin, please let us know and we will help you with the issues you may have","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AAaqdHXNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calindiana","source_asin":"B09BDCTRD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BDCTRD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BDCTRD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
