window.products.push({"id":350293,"name":"Domestic Corner - Over-The-Sink Dish Drying Rack - Roll Up Dish Drying Rack, Perfect for Cleaning & Drying Plates, Cups, Pots, Pan and Produce - Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b8mAfBPdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crammed for space in a tiny kitchen? No dishwasher? Looking for an extra surface for washing and rinsing vegetables? We all like a clean home, and cleanliness is most important in the kitchen. That's why here at Domestic Corner, we created our very own Over-The-Sink Dish Drying Rack. When you wash your fruits and vegetables, this collapsible drying rack doubles as a strainer, making it the perfect wash station for your produce. Wash your fruits and veggies, then let them dry on the rack while you prepare your other ingredients. The last thing you need when you’re washing and drying your favorite dinner set is a broken glass. The strong steel rods are easily capable of supporting heavy dinnerware, so you can let your pots and pots air dry over the sink on this folding drying mat. The durable, non-slip silicone finish ensures that your dinnerware stays in place on top of the sink while drying. You shouldn’t have to question whether tools for your kitchen are food safe. That’s why at Domestic Corner, we made sure our silicone-coated steel dish rack is BPA free and food safe. You’ll get frequent and long-term use out of this convenient kitchen gadget. It may be a simple tool, but it’s the little things that improve your day to day. The drying rack can be folded or rolled, so you can store it under the sink, in a drawer, or wherever it’s most convenient. When extended over the sink, it measures in at 20.5 in x 13 in x .25 in; rolled-up, it’s 20.5 in x 2 in diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b8mAfBPdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Domestic Corner","source_asin":"B0BQZDPBHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQZDPBHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQZDPBHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
