window.products.push({"id":350321,"name":"Steam Iron, 1800W Portable Steam-Dry Iron for Clothes, Non-Stick Soleplate Home Steam Iron, Anti-drip Iron with Auto-Off, Steam Control System, 470ml ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615DvnKM4hS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note: Using the included cup (2 cups) to fill the water tank. Do not exceed the MAX level otherwise it will cause water leakage. It only bursts steam when the soleplate reaches the temperature (Temperature adjustment > WOOL(Level 2)). Pretests will be carried before each iron gets packed. Harmless water residue may be found in the water tank due to these tests. It takes 3 seconds for the iron to preheat before bursting steam. Please press the Burst of steam button at the interval of 3 seconds in case water leaks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615DvnKM4hS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aleema","source_asin":"B098L12KDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098L12KDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098L12KDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350322,"name":"Bath Bliss Globe Shape Weighted Bottom Brush & Holder Set, Hygienic Rust Resistant, Heavy Duty Toilet-Brushes, 1 Pack, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K59WHKleL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Store your toilet brush in plain sight with the attractive Bath Bliss Toilet Brush Set. This brush and decorative storage container is discreet and will make a lovely accent to most bathroom decors. The handle and canister for the bathroom toilet brush have a slick finish and are constructed from a rust-resistant stainless steel. The set also has a durable, rounded, bristle brush that is designed to remain hidden when the product is not in use. This stainless steel toilet brush will keep both your bathroom and toilet looking their best. Globe shaped design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K59WHKleL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bath Bliss","source_asin":"B0BKG71KM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKG71KM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKG71KM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350323,"name":"LHS | Personalized My First Christmas Ornament Gift Box Incld Shatter Resistant Clear Acrylic Cute Baby Carriage | Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VdMJ7tcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your babes first Christmas ornament is a very big deal! Your newborns is a time for celebration every day, but you especially want something extra memorable this holiday. This newborn Christmas keepsake will be in your family for generations to come. You will re-live your baby girl or baby boys first Christmas together as either a new family of three, or addition to an already growing family of four, five, or six! This is a perfect gift for mom's first Christmas, dad's first Christmas, gender reveal announcements, baby showers, gift for stockings, godparent, grandchildren, and grandparents alike. Also a great gift for those baby showers through out the year as it is never too early to celebrate your first Christmas together. It is made and designed from scratch by a small family business of designers and engravers in Denver Colorado that truly care about making this as special as you desire it to be. This is truly a one of a kind ornament. You won't find it anywhere else. These Christmas decorations are not purchased and re-sold from some factory out of state or country. They are handmade and unique as-well-as a gift should be. Gifts are for giving, showing you care, and that person is in your thoughts. Giving a gift that is one of a kind and not something mass-produced makes this a very special unique find. Not to mention, it is your message that we engrave on this memento. It will be a keepsake that will last for generations to come and hung on the tree each and every year with you in their thoughts and memories. There are many ornaments to choose from. There can only be one that is from your heart to theirs. What a special time to be together and we hope this ornament will be one to remember forever. Merry Christmas from us to you. We sincerely hope is a special one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VdMJ7tcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LHS Engraving","source_asin":"B08M685ZZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M685ZZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M685ZZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
