window.products.push({"id":350327,"name":"Togiharu Wa-Sujihiki 10.5\" (27cm) with Saya","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NIScM96ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY ASSURANCE 🔪: These elegant knives feature a stain resistant 70:30 western blade on a traditional Japanese magnolia wood handle with a water buffalo horn bolster. HAND SHARPENED 🔪: The final edge finishing process is done by hand, ensuring unparalleled sharpness right out of the box. PRECISION 🔪: The Sujihiki is a slicing knife intended for slicing boneless fish filets and proteins. The short height of the blade creates less friction when slicing and the entire blade draws through fish and meat effortlessly. LIGHT & NIMBLE 🔪: Lightweight and thin, Japanese chef knives have a sharper blade and maintain their sharpness longer than most other chef knives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NIScM96ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOGIHARU","source_asin":"B00GBFK8A0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GBFK8A0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GBFK8A0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350328,"name":"Masterplay 3-Piece Fine Printed (104\" X 90\") Quilt Set, Bedspread Coverlet King Size Bed Cover (Grey, Dark Grey, Aqua, Blue, Paisley)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vW0wY87PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber is an all-season fabric with its ability to hold color well. Stain Resistant-People with children and those looking for sturdy material for a bedroom, children's room or RV may especially like microfiber fabric for its durability and stain resistance. The material is so tightly woven — with fibers thinner than a human hair that it naturally repels water and stains. Even highly staining substances like coffee can usually be wiped away without a trace if they are caught right away. Get a classy and comfortable finish every time you make up your room. This soft fabric resist wrinkling and fading and item comes in various colors and textures to suit your needs and decorate your homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vW0wY87PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Masterplay","source_asin":"B08R38L35W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R38L35W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R38L35W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
