window.products.push({"id":350405,"name":"Azeeda 4 x 'Infinity Paws' Temporary Tattoos (TO00012777)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JRHbl8+-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You don't need to spend a fortune on a permanent and, let's face it, painful inking, simply apply our temporary tattoos for a quick and pain free transformation; ideal for fancy dress and pool parties, impressing your mates or even as a test drive before committing to the real thing. All of our temporary tattoos are skin safe and non-toxic, water resistant, easy to apply and remove. They last up to 1 week, depending on the area applied to and how often it's washed. This set contains 1 sheet with 4 temporary tattoos of the same design in 3 different sizes; individual design sizes can be found on the product image. How to Use1. Ensure skin is clean and dry.2. Cut out the tattoo of your choice and trim close to the design.3. Gently remove the clear sheet and discard. Avoid touch the adhesive!4. Place the tattoo adhesive side down in desired position on the skin.5. Wet the back of the tattoo with a towel or sponge and press firmly for 10-15 seconds.6. Gently remove the backing paper and carefully remove any excess gel residue.7. Allow the tattoo to dry. How to Remove8. To remove the tattoo wipe with alcohol or baby oil, wait 10 seconds, then rub gently and repeatedly until the tattoo sticker has been removed. Notes: Not intended for children under 6 years. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. Do not put directly on eye. Do not apply to sensitive skin, near eyes, or if allergic to adhesive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JRHbl8+-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Azeeda","source_asin":"B09XLVMYTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XLVMYTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XLVMYTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350406,"name":"Delta Children Easel and Play Station, Disney/Pixar Cars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UN6wQzdxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Time to get crafty! Designed to help your little one express their creative side, the Disney/Pixar Cars Activity Center from Delta Children provides the space and storage your budding artist needs. The 3-in-1 design features a magnetic dry-erase board that can be positioned for your child to sit and draw with markers, or stowed upright to reveal a spacious tabletop to complete craft projects. On the other side of the easel a fabric toy bin and two tiers of storage pockets offers convenient compartments for art supplies, toys and books. Adorned with colorful Cars graphics of Lightning McQueen, Jackson and Cruz, this Activity Center makes everyday endeavors more inspiring. About Cars: The ultimate speed racer, Lightning McQueen, loves going faster than fast! A four-time Piston Cup winner and World Grand Prix favorite, McQueen's cool and confident attitude paired with a supercharged V-8 engine, free-flowing dual exhaust and speeds that reach 200 MPH makes him the wheel deal. Off the track, he spends most of his time in Radiator Springs-a small town along Route 66-with his best bud, Tow Mater and girlfriend, Sally Carrera.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UN6wQzdxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Children","source_asin":"B072VJ1168","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072VJ1168","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072VJ1168","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
