window.products.push({"id":350425,"name":"Tribe Glare Decruster Bread Sandwich Maker mold-Uncrustables Sandwich Cutter Sealer for Kids and DIY cookie cutter Lunch Lunchbox and Bento Box of Chi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mPDqX6ZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make your own homemade uncrustables frozen PB&J sandwiches part of your weekly meal prep day.And YOU control the quality of the ingredients. Perfectly portable, great for road trips, vacation, as well as packed lunches!  Is your kids get tired of eating normal sandwich? Then get these food cutters and sealers to make your own lovely and healthy sandwich, make your food look extra delicious.  Package contents 5pcs/set, it can make two different sizes sandwich (diameter is 2.79in and 3.54 inch) How to cut and seal two different sizes sandwich? large size sandwich: 1.Prepare two pieces of toast, then use the largest cutter cut and press on the toast. 2.Remove the crust, the “common” PCS (the third pcs) can cut something like egg, bacon, cheese, veg. Ect to put in the middle of these larger sandwich. 3.Push the largest sealer through the cutter and press.  Small size sandwich: 1.Prepare two pieces of toast, then use the “common” PCS (the third/C pcs) cutter cut and press on the toast. 2.Remove the crust, the smallest cutter can cut something like egg, bacon, cheese, veg. Ect to put in the middle of these smaller sandwich. 3.Push the smallest sealer through the cutter and press.  Our unique design sandwich cutter and sealer is super durable and safe, we tested that the piece is still intact after it was thrown down from 10 feet high onto the floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mPDqX6ZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribe Glare","source_asin":"B0B6RNDRBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6RNDRBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6RNDRBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
