window.products.push({"id":350452,"name":"SAYGOGO Bathroom Wooden Soap Case Holder, Rectangular Hand Craft, Natural Wooden Holder for Sponges","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T49Hvf4JL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to Use: Natural soap needs to drain and dry if you want to preserve it correctly, and that's where our Soap Club soap dish comes in, with its large curved slats that help that excess water runoff, while at the same time allowing it to be well ventilated.Saving Your Soap Is As Easy As Step 1-2-31. Remove your soap from a wet or moist area.2. Place the soap on the surface of our soap tray, so that it can drain thoroughly.3. Ensure the soap dish is in a cool, dry area.Features: 1.Hand Made By Craftsmen2.Non-Toxic - To You And Your Soap3. Unlike many soap holders, ours is coated with a non-toxic finish that is odor-free, non-yellowing, and with zero volatile organic compounds.4. This means there is nothing to taint the scent of your herbal soap, and no allergens to trigger sensitivities that you or your family may have.5. Modern, Contemporary Design Makes A Perfect Gift.6. This soap dish will fit in with any decor in any room of your house and is ideal as a gift for the most discerning of friends.7. Take Care Of Your Handmade Soap The Soap Club Way With Our All-Natural Handmade Beechwood Soap Dish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T49Hvf4JL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAYGOGO","source_asin":"B0BZVC6MBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZVC6MBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZVC6MBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
