window.products.push({"id":350480,"name":"Silicone Utensil Rest with Drip Pad for Multiple Utensils,BPA-Free Spoon Rest & Spoon Holder for Stove Top,Heat-Resistant,Kitchen Utensil Holder for S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41piLCzt+YL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","description":"Whether you're a seasoned chef or a culinary newcomer, keeping a clean kitchen counter space is a must! This silicone spoon holder is the perfect space saving solution to keep your cooking utensils neatly organized and off of your counters during your next Epicurean adventure. Increases the modern look of any stove top! Not only keeps Your Countertops Neat & Drip-free,but also enhance the look of any kitchen.Made of food-grade, heat-resistant, non-slip silicone.It is dishwasher friendly and BPA-free.Four slots design spoon rests for use of multiple utensils without cross-contamination.Sturdy space friendly spoon rack is the ideal tool to keep counters neat and organized while cooking.The utensil rack is designed with a lip around the edges that catches any drips,so you can focus on cooking instead of cleaning. Adds Value to Any Kitchen! Great for cooking, baking, or grilling.Rest for utensils, gadgets, or cutlery, such as spoon, fork, brush, spatula, ladle and tongs etc.Heat resistant, temperature range -40-250 degree.Safe for ovens, microwave ovens, dishwashers and freezers.Durable and flexible.Our utensil holder has 4 notches that allow users to rest multiple utensils at once. Drip pad keeps counters clean from a dirty spoon, spatula or ladle. Both fun and functional,this colorful spoon rest is designed to cradle your dirty kitchen utensils such as spoons, ladles or brushes securely in place while giving a colorful touch to your worktop. More convenient than conventional spoon rester or silicone spoon holder, spatula or ladel dish.The best price, the best quality products, and save money. Order Now and Take Advantage of our Lifetime Money Back Guarantee! If for any reason you aren’t fully satisfied, EMAIL US SAYING WHY. We will give you a full refund or free replacement. Never deal with returning to Amazon. We respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41piLCzt+YL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sinnsally","source_asin":"B08WZ68873","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WZ68873","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WZ68873","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
