window.products.push({"id":350792,"name":"Recaceik Sideboard Buffet Storage Cabinet with Sliding Barn Door and Adjustable Shelve, Farmhouse Coffee Bar Cabinet Entryway Console Table for Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uS1Kj3S9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Buffet Sideboard Cabinet Design】Recaceik Buffet Sideboard adds a natural touch to the kitchen with its wood finish and farmhouse barn door design with a simple decorative look. The farmhouse-inspired, streamlined coffee bar cabinet will give you endless glamour, and the spacious entryway cabinet tabletop can hold some flowers or accessories to add a touch of rustic elegance to your space. ☕【Sturdy Coffee Bar Cabinets】Sideboards and Buffets with Storage are constructed of wood grain veneer particleboard for stability and durability in farmhouse storage cabinets. Buffet Cabinet Weight Capacity: 58 lbs (overall), 11 lbs (shelf), 11 lbs (drawer); The buffet cabinet flows in the corners with a graceful curve, making the sides and elevation bring the same effect to the kitchen. ☕【Sliding Doors and Adjustable Interior Shelve】Modern Farmhouse Style Furniture Storage Cabinets with Vintage Barn Door Sliding Doors evoke rustic charm in your home. The dining room buffet cabinet has 5 storage shelves, providing compact storage space for everyday accessories, cutlery and plates. The top shelf in the left compartment is adjustable. ☕【Multifunctional Buffet and Sideboard】The sideboard buffet's overall dimensions: 31.89\" W x 15.75\" D x 31.89\" H. If you're looking for a stylish piece to refresh your dining room, then this versatile sideboard is for you suitable for the size of the space. You can use a sideboard in many different areas, such as the entrance, hallway, bedroom, kitchen or dining room, etc. It can even be used as a media shelf. ☕【Easy to Assemble Sideboard Console Table】Sideboard and buffet table with storage come with clear and short instructions and all hardware for assembly. Each screw and plate has its own code for easy identification and assembly. What's more, the smooth surface facilitates daily maintenance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uS1Kj3S9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Recaceik","source_asin":"B0B5GZ3HT7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5GZ3HT7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5GZ3HT7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350793,"name":"Winsome Perrone, 3 Piece Set, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":261.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u0y7A5OQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take home a blend of grace and simplicity with the Winsome Wood Perrone High Table Set, an indispensable addition to any home. Offering exceptional versatility and making this an excellent space saving choice for a studio apartment or small spaces where a multipurpose table is ideal. Needing more surface space, this unique design offers the utmost in stability for expanding the table size. Pull out the apron, and the legs support the drop leaf when open, slide the apron back when the drop leaf is folded. With the leaf extended, the table seats four comfortably but for daily living keep the drop leaf down and conserve valuable floor space. A center drawer with a satin nickel finish knob keeps pens, pads, and other smaller items within easy reach. This table set is paired with two classically designed stools that are a perfect complement to the table. With comfortable contoured seats and striking, ladder-back design. These comfortable stools have a striking, ladder-back design that's ideal for any decor style, from rustic to modern. Offering a broad seat sitting at 24.02”H with a contouring seat back and wide set legs that lend tip free support. Enjoy this set for casual dining or use the table as a console or convenient place to work on your laptop. Constructed of sturdy solid wood for long lasting durability and finished in a rich walnut, this set can be incorporated effortlessly into nearly any existing decor. Ships in 2 boxes that include the hardware necessary for assembling. Replacement part request can be submitted directly to the manufacturer within 60 days from date of purchase. Overall table dimensions: 29.1\"H x 40\"W x 34.8\"D (with leaf extended) 29.1\"H x 40\"W x 21.6\"D (with leaf closed) - leaf dimension is 40\"W x 14\"D Inside drawer dimensions: 12.1\"W x 8.9\"D x 2\"H Clearance underneath table (Front): 24.8\"H x 34.1\"W Clearance underneath table (Side): 24.8\"H x 14.2\"W Stool assembled size is 16.4\"W x 19.6\"D x 39.4\"H Seat Dimension is 16.4\"W x 15.5\"D (24\" seat height) - Static Weight limit 220 Lbs. Assembly required Ships in 2 boxes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u0y7A5OQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winsome","source_asin":"B086BRKW67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086BRKW67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086BRKW67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
