window.products.push({"id":350820,"name":"Neos Modern Furniture Modern Wooden Kitchen Bar Counter Height Table, 40\", White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":409.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5155mpz0l+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Neos Modern Furniture neo Collection wooden bar table with lacquer finish is expertly crafted with the finest wood. Built to withstand the test of time, The lacquer finish on the bar table s that scuffs and water damage are no longer a worry. With a clean and simple design, The bar table is the ideal contemporary piece for any household. It's compact size also ensures that it is perfect for any living space where floor space is limited. Looking for an alternative for a formal dining table or need extra counter space in a small kitchen? Look no further than the wooden bar table. Neos Modern Furniture brings a modern edge to the classic home. We stay on top of the trends so you are always up to date. Our high quality products are ready to be a part of your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5155mpz0l+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neos Modern Furniture","source_asin":"B08HFNT24H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HFNT24H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HFNT24H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350821,"name":"Esatto Professional Bar Tool Muddler 25 CM (10 Inches) Ribbed – Made with ABS Plastic – Durable and Ribbed for Mashing Fruits, Berries, Sugar, Spices,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B+RCSjn3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MUDDLERS – The muddler is an ideal bartending tools that also helps bartenders prepare different drinks. Use the muddlers to mash ingredients like herbs, spices, sugar, salt, and berries. One end is ribbed, with this end conveniently being used to smash fruits and berries instead of doing it by hand. The other end has a smooth surface that is used to easily crush sugar and spices. The mashed and crushed ingredients can then be added to a variety of drinks. COMPLETE YOUR DRINK REPERTOIRE – As the saying goes, variety is the spice of life. When customers go to a bar, it is best to be prepared for whatever they may want. They may have a specific drink that they continuously order, but it may not hurt to have more drinks on the menu to offer them. This can all be done with the muddler. Drinks that require a muddler include mojitos, a mint julep, an old fashioned, and many more. You can offer a little something for everybody. EFFICIENCY IN YOUR HANDS – Certain cocktails require some amount of effort to put together. Mixing drinks is a work in precision and speed. Bartenders want to mix it well and get the flavor just right, while also making sure it is quickly served so other customers can be served. With the muddler, bartenders gain an efficiency that allows them to prepare drinks faster and better. Constant efficiency in the bar allows you to contribute more to the success of your bar. DURABLE – Our muddlers are made with ABS plastic. The ABS plastic is a material that is deemed safe for the purpose of food and drink processing. It also has inherent resistances that maintain its durability. Finally, it is extremely easy to clean the professional muddler bar tool. All bartender need to do is simply wash it and then let it dry for any upcoming services. It is a much stronger plastic that makes our muddlers very durable. You’ll be using these for years to come. QUALITY ON A BUDGET – If you are looking for a bar tool that can improve efficiency, make things easier, and improve service overall, Esatto's muddler is exactly what you are looking for. Not only can bartenders prepare drinks easier, they can also offer an expanded repertoire of drinks to the customers. This item is very affordable, and for what you are paying for it, as well as the amount of quality work you can get out of it, it is simply a steal for professional bars and bartenders. PREMIUM PACKAGING. Esatto's muddler comes in beautiful premium packaging. Esatto combines design with functionality, ensuring that every item is packed neat and well. The packaging also makes it an ideal bartender gifts for men. Whether you are gifting it to a fellow bartender, or to someone who has a home bar, this will be a useful and welcome addition. It is also a great gift idea for birthdays, weddings, housewarming presents, and many more occasions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B+RCSjn3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esatto","source_asin":"B0BNR52PH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNR52PH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNR52PH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
