window.products.push({"id":350861,"name":"Komax Biokips Spaghetti Container Storage Noodle/Pasta Container 44oz (set of 4) - Airtight, Leakproof with Locking Lids - BPA Free Plastic - Microwav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+09Kq82TS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⚡ ORIGINAL & PRIZE WINNING DESIGN - In 2004, Komax Biokips collection awarded one of the best design awards in the world, the \"Red Dot Design Award\". Biokip four-sided locking lids are the first design containers ever created. In addition to their durability and lasting airtight technology, Biokips absolute powers are marvelously beyond comparison. Dimensions: 4.3 x 10.7 (h). ⚡ PERFECT SIZE FOR PASTA - Biokips cylindrical pasta storage containers are the ideal size for all pasta types. Each canister can fit a 1-lb box of pasta and at least two boxes of thin spaghetti each. With 44 ounce volume, Biokips pasta containers are suited for spaghetti noodles, linguine, fusilli, farfalle, garganelli, and other shaped pasta. Take control of your pasta portions, and save a little more. ⚡ AIRTIGHT FOR LIFE - Biokips 4-tabs locking lid is designed with robust construction, that will safeguard your pasta and guarantee maximum freshness. Needless to say, the two containers are BPA-free, and eco-friendly. When it comes to your family food storage, we believe healthy materials and food safety are the number one priority. ⚡ DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE, FREEZER SAFE - Made of one the most versatile, eco-friendly types of plastic. PP (polypropylene) used by Komax is tested under extreme temperatures and has proven strong after extensive use. The two containers are easy to clean by hand or in the dishwasher. ⚡ MADE IN SOUTH KOREA - After 47 years of innovation, Komax products brought sweet joy to the hearts of millions of customers. Originality, unique concepts and food safety attribute established Komax as a leading pioneer. Biokips pasta containers are no exception, they're delightfully compact, lightweight and capable of securing your fresh pasta for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+09Kq82TS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Komax","source_asin":"B09S2RLRPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S2RLRPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S2RLRPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
