window.products.push({"id":350917,"name":"Upgraded 4-Blade Fireplace Fan,Heat Powered Wood Stove Fan Wood Burning/Log Burner/Fireplace,Eco-Friendly Efficient Heat Distribution, Heat Resistance","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uONsPbheL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Features *Easy to install Place on a flat surface of stove top and away from flue pipe. Temperature about 250°C(482°F) would be perfect. *No running cost Stove fan operated automatically by heat of stove or fireplace which burns wood, log and multi fuels.No extra electricity,batteries or fuel required. * Best position If you feel a little air flow, try to change the position.it's better to put the fan on the left rear or right rear of fireplace,photo shows the right place. *No need to stay so close to the fire anymore. Heat power fan helps to move the warm air throughout your room instead of warm air rising to the ceiling or just being trapped around the stove. *Whisper Quiet You can lie on the sofa leisurely, read a book, Knit，rest,and experience the warmth quietly,which brought from Ful-hope hot energy stove fan. If you hear some noise when the fan running,check blades bent or not ,It may be deformed during transportation, try to adjust it or contact us. * A free pair of heat resistant BBQ glove The gloves can provide a ultra protection against heat up to 1472°F (800℃) for10-15 seconds Note: Never place the fan on an unprotected surface if the fan base is still hot Keep all obstacles at a distance while the fan in use. To move or carry the fan, always using the extendable handle on the top and wearing gloves. Ensure children and pets are supervised around your stove. Product specifications: *Material: Anodized aluminum oxide * AirFlow: 280-360 CFM (cubic feet per minute) *Noise: <32dB *Product size: 21*13*16(CM)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uONsPbheL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ful-hope","source_asin":"B07JMGKCK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JMGKCK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JMGKCK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
