window.products.push({"id":350974,"name":"Just Makes Scents Country Clothesline (Downy Type) Scented Blended Soy Candle | Fresh Clean Laundry Fragrance | Hand Poured in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712B9JDJS8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Country Clothesline: If you like the light fragrance of Downy Fabric Softener, then you'll love Country Clothesline. Smells like fresh clean linen straight from the dryer. The aroma of fresh powder, light musk, and just a hint of fresh spring flowers of daffodils and tulips. Our homemade candles are made from the highest quality blended soy wax, metal free wicks, and premium fragrance oils. We mix in the maximum quantity of fragrance oil while maintaining smoke free burning. Our self-trimming cotton and paper fiber wicks require minimal trimming, but should always be kept under 1/4\" for maximum performance. Never leave burning candles unattended and keep away from children. Take care where candles are placed as the jar does become quite hot during burning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712B9JDJS8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Just Makes Scents","source_asin":"B00NPA9JXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NPA9JXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NPA9JXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350975,"name":"Kids Table and 2 Chairs, Green and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-GUT9MfcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description Why Sprout? Our products require no tools, no hardware, and are simple to assemble. Tension Lock Tool-Less Technology uses the natural properties of wood to create a sturdy durable joint. Sprout is great furniture for small spaces. If you live in an apartment, studio, starter house with shared rooms, or even your dream home, sprout organization products provides you a beautiful, modern way to use your space more efficiently. Collapse and store your products when not in use. Sprout is also designed as a medium of creativity. An opportunity for kids to explore & understand the world around them. Build it and re-design it with your kids. Let them see that they can do amazing things with our creative kid’s furniture. Sprout Products are modular, meaning you can mix, match and reconfigure your products. Bins, art tiles, and frames are sized to work with various storage products. Add your personal touch with art work and customized design. Sprout cardboard products & Packaging are 100% Recyclable, helping us be good stewards of our earth. Sprout furniture is American made; i.e., designed & manufactured in the US. Because our products are sourced from quality, local materials, you can have confidence they will last long enough that someday your grandchildren will be able to enjoy them. Sprout products are made from recycled pre & post-consumer recycled materials. Local sourcing means less shipping and ultimately a cleaner earth. At sprout we strive to design modern kid’s furniture that fits your taste and lifestyle; furniture that you can use in any space. At Sprout, we agree with Leonardo Da Vinci when he said “Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication.\" Sprout furniture demonstrates there is beauty in simplicity. From the Manufacturer The Sprout Kids Table and Chairs are perfect for drawing, play, or projects. Use it like a folding table, break it down when you don't need it and set it up again in just seconds when you need it. Easy assembly is simple enough for your kids to figure out. The seat, back, and brace of the chairs can be swapped with other chairs, rockers, or cubbies to change the style, color, or even the function of your kid’s chair. Sprout furniture comes flat packed and ready to assemble. Tool-less assembly is simple and easy, just pop the modular components together and you’re done. Furniture is easily collapsible making moving and storage easy. And because there is no hardware, you have nothing to lose. Sprout products are designed with our environment in mind. Made of CARB Compliant MDF, a sustainable pre-consumer recycled wood product, the Sprout Kids Chair is furniture solution your children will love. Sprout products are designed be very simple to manufacture, while maximizing material usage and minimizing waste. Because Sprout furniture is manufactured in the USA, it avoids unnecessary shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-GUT9MfcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sprout","source_asin":"B006L95SA6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006L95SA6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006L95SA6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
