window.products.push({"id":350990,"name":"Extra Large 3D Skull Ice Cube Mold for Whiskey with Tray, Silicone Skull Ice Maker Mold with Funnel, Chocolate Sugar Skull Mold for Baking, Reusable a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F1P963vdL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"Key Features: 1. Funny and joyful novelty idea of putting a vivid ice skull in your bottle.And it is great for halloween, christmas, summer pool parties, restaurants and bars. Best for gift. 2. Food Grade Silicone Skull Ice Mold,Reusable & BPA Free. 3. A mini funnel makes filling easily without leaking and avoids over-filling. Silicone ice trays won't crack or break like stiff plastic molds after freezing. Soft material and quick open buckle design make release effortlessly. Ice Skull Mold Instructions: 1. Align the ice skull mold lid and press tightly (Just try a few more times and you will become more successful). 2. Inject pure water about 95% (water will expand after freezing), so that the ice skull will be realistic. 3. Stable put it in the refrigerator and freeze for 4-6 hours (Try not to shake the ice mold after it is filled with water). 4. Leave it for a while after taking it out of the refrigerator, it will easier to take out the ice skull. Why Choose A Extra Large Ice Skull -- Larger size melts more slower than small skull shape ice cube. -- The extra large ice skull could while keeping the drink cold for a longer period of time and ideal for minimal dilution of your drink.  -- There are a few ice skulls for whiskey to consider using because of how easy they are to make to ensure you can make an impression on your family, friends gathering. Multifunction: 1. Best choice for whiskey, cocktail, brandy, scotch, bourbon, blended whiskey, liquor drink. 2. Creates slow melting ice skulls that are perfect for non-alcoholic beverages, even Coffee. Freezes pretty much anything including jelly, chocolate, popsicles, puddings, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F1P963vdL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JTW","source_asin":"B08H7XL8MH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H7XL8MH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H7XL8MH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":350991,"name":"SleepJoy 3-inch ViscO2 Memory Foam Mattress Topper with Breathable Design, Made in The USA – King Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GFyeirP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plush INSTANT MATTRESS ENHANCEMENT: Easily upgrade your mattress with a luxurious layer of high-quality memory foam. When you experience the gentle contouring and pressure point relief, you’ll sleep deeper and wake refreshed. Imagine feeling like you’re sleeping on a plush pillow top mattress, without the new mattress price. It’s the best way to add comfort anywhere: in the dorm, guest room, or master suite. BREATHABLE DESIGN: Cooler sleep means deeper sleep, so we designed this mattress topper for maximum breathability. Our open-cell memory foam allows for the free flow of air throughout the entire sleep surface for a comfortable sleep temperature. PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM: Our ViscO2 memory foam offers superior durability, holding its shape over time for years of enjoyment. Plus, ViscO2 is odor-neutral, thanks to our unique manufacturing process that eliminates the need to air the product out before use. That means you can use the mattress topper right away and sleep better on night one. MADE IN THE USA: We proudly manufacture this topper right here in the USA and adhere to all quality standards -- ensuring consistent delivery of a product you can trust. Overseas products may have fewer safeguards and unknown ingredients that can affect both safety and quality. We stand behind this product with a limited 2-year warranty and our US-based customer service team is here to answer any questions. FRIENDLIER TO THE ENVIRONMENT: You can sleep soundly knowing that what you purchased is friendlier to the environment than other products on the market. This memory foam topper is enhanced with plant-based materials derived from castor beans, which have a lower carbon footprint than traditional memory foam or soy-based foams. Our foam is certified by CertiPUR-US to meet standards for content, emissions and durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GFyeirP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SleepJoy","source_asin":"B000NNI3AS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-350991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NNI3AS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NNI3AS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
